      "scenes": {
        "RB00": {
          "shot": "reply",
          "act": 0,
          "speed": 1.0,
          "after": 0.35,
          "outcomes": [
            "你陪 Ruby 留下二十分钟。",
            "你决定保留自己的下午，Ruby 接受今天不散步。"
          ],
          "before": [
            [
              "旁白",
              "A tram bell fades beyond the café door.",
              "咖啡馆门外，一阵电车铃声渐渐远去。"
            ]
          ],
          "cuts": [
            {
              "from": 0,
              "shot": "cafe"
            },
            {
              "from": 2,
              "shot": "reply"
            }
          ],
          "question": [
            "How would you like to spend your afternoon?",
            "你想怎么安排这个下午？"
          ],
          "replace": [
            {
              "english": "And this form needs to go in tonight.",
              "with": [
                "My marine project application is due tonight.",
                "我的海洋项目申请今晚截止。"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "insertAfter": [
            {
              "english": "My marine project application is due tonight.",
              "lines": [
                [
                  "Ruby",
                  "I'd get to help with research, not just clean-ups.",
                  "这样就能参与研究，不只是清理海滩。"
                ],
                [
                  "Ruby",
                  "I've filled in my name. That's about it.",
                  "我只填了名字，差不多就这些。"
                ]
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        "RB10": {
          "shot": "form",
          "act": 1,
          "speed": 1.0,
          "after": 0.35,
          "outcomes": [
            "Ruby 读出有关瓶盖的开头，申请还没提交。",
            "你们各做各的事，二十分钟后各自继续。"
          ],
          "insertAfter": [
            {
              "english": "She finds a photo from a beach clean-up.",
              "lines": [
                [
                  "Ruby",
                  "Port Phillip Bay. We went back the next week.",
                  "菲利普港湾，我们下一周又去了。"
                ],
                [
                  "Ruby",
                  "Same patch of sand. More bottle caps.",
                  "同一片沙滩，又捡到了瓶盖。"
                ],
                [
                  "Ruby",
                  "I want to know what keeps bringing them back.",
                  "我想弄清是什么不断把它们带回来。"
                ]
              ]
            }
          ],
          "question": [
            "How would you like to spend these twenty minutes?",
            "这二十分钟，你想怎么待着？"
          ]
        },
        "RB11": {
          "shot": "form",
          "act": 2,
          "speed": 0.98,
          "after": 0.6,
          "insertAfter": [
            {
              "english": "I wanted to know where they came from.",
              "lines": [
                [
                  "旁白",
                  "She deletes 'passionate' and keeps the beach in the form.",
                  "她删掉“充满热情”，把海滩的经历留在表里。"
                ],
                [
                  "Ruby",
                  "It wasn't a lovely day out. But I went back.",
                  "那可不是什么美好的郊游，但我又去了。"
                ]
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        "RB12": {
          "shot": "form",
          "act": 2,
          "speed": 0.98,
          "after": 0.6,
          "insertAfter": [
            {
              "english": "For a while, there is only typing and café noise.",
              "lines": [
                [
                  "旁白",
                  "The grinder starts. She waits, then reads her line again.",
                  "磨豆机响起来，她等了一会儿，又读了一遍自己写的话。"
                ]
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        "RB20": {
          "shot": "reply",
          "act": 1,
          "speed": 1.0,
          "after": 0.35,
          "outcomes": [
            "双方约好故事内明天下午四点再见。",
            "这次没有定下新的散步日期。"
          ],
          "question": [
            "Would you like to choose another day?",
            "你想现在另选一天吗？"
          ]
        },
        "RB21": {
          "shot": "lane",
          "act": 2,
          "speed": 0.98,
          "after": 0.6
        },
        "RB22": {
          "shot": "lane",
