            "你先吃饭，双方约定一点二十短见。",
            "你吃完离开，今天不再见面。"
          ],
          "insertAfter": [
            {
              "english": "The stock delivery came while I was on my own.",
              "lines": [
                [
                  "Marcus",
                  "Used records. Half the sleeves had no price.",
                  "一批二手唱片，一半封套上都没标价。"
                ],
                [
                  "Marcus",
                  "The other clerk gets here at one.",
                  "另一位店员一点才到。"
                ]
              ]
